but I don't trust Kaiba at all.

59
00:03:58,940 --> 00:04:00,800
You're going down, Kaiba.

60
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:02,840
Well, you're going up, Wheeler.

61
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:05,080
And in this duel, that's worse.

62
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:06,780
Yeah, we'll see.

63
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,500
Joey, stay calm.

64
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,896
You must maintain your concentration.

65
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:13,040
Now then, my move!

66
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,520
Hang on, Mai.

67
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:21,902
My brother's going to
rescue you soon, I promise.

68
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,960
You can count on Joey.

69
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:30,990
Joey?

70
00:04:31,073 --> 00:04:31,977
Who's Joey?

71
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:33,620
Where am I?

72
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,420
Don't worry, Mai.

73
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:38,721
Joey's not going to let you down.

74
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:40,857
He always comes through.

75
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,960
And he's out there
fighting for you right now.

76
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:45,810
Wow.

77
00:04:45,893 --> 00:04:46,723
You can do it, Joey.

78
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,000
I know you can.

79
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,550
Alright.

80
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:56,440
Now, which duelist should I attack?

81
00:04:57,580 --> 00:05:00,237
Kaiba has Blade Knight on
the field in attack mode,

82
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,908
plus two face-down cards
to protect himself.

83
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:07,940
Marek has Dark Geroid in play,
and so far he's in last place.

84
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:11,082
But if I attack him, Kaiba
may protect him again.

85
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:16,217
And poor Joey has no monsters
on the field to shield himself.

86
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:18,124
He's in the worst shape of all.

87
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,460
Won't you guys stop staring at me?

88
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,980
Big deal.

89
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,097
So my defense has seen better days.

90
00:05:25,180 --> 00:05:28,037
I have to make sure that Joey
doesn't end up dueling Merrick.

91
