96
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,350
Merrick!

97
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:44,117
Yugi's in a really tight spot,

98
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:46,197
because his best bet is to duel Kaiba in

99
