111
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,500
Joey, wait!

112
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:23,797
I have no choice.

113
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,040
I gotta save her!

114
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:29,420
I know you feel bad, but what
happened to Mai isn't your fault.

115
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:35,000
I appreciate you trying to help,
but I know what I have to do, Taya.

116
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:36,977
Just be careful, Joey.

117
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:39,137
Maric is not someone
you want to mess with.

118
00:06:39,220 --> 00:06:43,017
Look, I know if I beat that evil
freak in a duel, I can get Mai back.

119
00:06:43,100 --> 00:06:44,520
So I'll take my chances.

120
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:48,360
I know I have what it takes
to pull this off, Taya.

121
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:50,952
And besides, I got you guys in my corner.

122
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,845
Are you sure about this, Joey?

123
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:55,977
I've never been more sure
of anything in my life.

124
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:59,220
I owe it to Mai and to
myself to face Marek.

125
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:03,694
If I back away from this fight now,
I'll never be able to forgive myself.

126
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,240
I've made up my mind.

127
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:09,547
I gave Mai my word that I wouldn't
let anything happen to her.

128
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:13,397
And Joey Wheeler would never
break a promise to a friend.

129
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,833
So look out, Marek, because here I come.

130
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,940
Wow, that's pretty heavy.

131
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,711
Talk about determination.

132
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:22,845
I just hope he knows what
he's doing out there.

133
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:27,277
Yeah, I'd hate to think of what'll
happen if Joey faces Marek and loses.

134
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,820
I've made my choice.

135
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:31,141
Now, my Beast of Guilfur, attack!

136
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:34,760
