142
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,301
You shouldn't be attacking Marek.

143
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:54,008
You should be attacking me.

144
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:55,600
Trust me, Yuge.

145
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:56,920
I don't get it.

146
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:58,295
What's Joey thinking?

147
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,160
I'd say he's not thinking.

148
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:03,437
Hey, Joey, I think the
pressure's getting to you.

149
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:06,260
Just relax and let Yu-Gi make his move.

150
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:08,406
Just stay out of it, Tristan.

151
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:11,460
This is something that
I have to do. Yu-Gi,

152
