Not so fast.

192
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,440
Now, reveal Jinso!

193
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:55,560
Now, I sacrifice my battle warrior in
order to summon the legendary fisherman.

194
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,360
And now,

195
00:10:59,540 --> 00:11:05,400
I sacrifice my alligator's sword and my
swordsman of Landstar so I can summon this,

196
