197
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:14,657
Every one of my battle city
victories is paying off right now.

198
00:11:14,740 --> 00:11:17,387
Those duels got me three
incredible monsters!

199
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:22,857
I've come a really long way since
the Battle City tournament began,

200
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:24,460
