226
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:40,937
We'll whoop this merit creep and
his rare hunter goon squad so hard.

227
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,667
They won't know what hit him

228
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,030
Thanks, Joey.

229
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:52,406
I'm sorry I let you down, Mai, but I
promise I'm gonna get you out of this mess.

230
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,220
I understand, Joey.

231
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:59,600
And I believe in you.

232
00:13:00,220 --> 00:13:02,180
