250
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,050
No, dummy.

251
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:12,900
I'm giving it to you so you
can enter the next round. Huh?

252
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:16,120
Just do me one little
favor out there, hon.

253
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:18,516
Win that prize money for your sister.

254
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,985
I've made it to the top again.

255
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,837
Only this time, I'm dueling for you, my...

256
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:26,880
I summon Axe Raider!

257
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:33,120
This is his chance to
launch an attack on Merrick.

258
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:36,860
Time for me to attack a
certain unlucky someone.

259
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:42,060
And I choose you, Kaiba.

260
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,460
I'm confused.

261
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,520
I thought he was after
Merrick. Yeah, me too.

262
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:50,217
So why did he direct his attack at Kaiba?

263
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:52,888
It could be that Joey
finally chickened out.

264
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:56,017
Unless this is all part of his strategy to

265
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:58,337
make sure he duels
Merrick in the next round.

266
00:14:58,420 --> 00:15:01,537
But there's no way Joey's
attack is gonna work, Duke.

267
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:05,377
Seto will just strike back by
activating one of his face down cards.

268
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:06,290
Axe Raider!

269
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:08,440
Attack Kaiba's blade knight, now!

270
00:15:09,660 --> 00:15:10,717
What a loser.

271
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:12,660
I bet Kaiba set a trap!

272
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,118
This'll never work!

273
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:19,980
You triggered my trap. Too bad.

274
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,740
Meet my Ring of Destruction.

275
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:28,060
It annihilates whatever monster wears
it, so your Axe Raider is history.

276
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:32,320
And both players will
lose 1,700 life points.

277
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:33,660
Not exactly.

278
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,260
Mine are safe.

279
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:38,980
Thanks to my Ring of Defense magic card.

280
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:43,720
It shields me from the
blast of my trap card.

281
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,420
Oh well.

282
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,540
Ring of Destruction, go!

283
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,120
Joey, no!

284
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:59,177
Does this mean that all of
Joey's life points are gone?

285
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:00,160
You got it.

286
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,697
Told you you shouldn't
mess with my brother.

287
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:03,610
Hold on.

288
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:05,900
Something else is going on up there.

289
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,460
Why have my life points gone to zero?

290
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:13,740
What did you just do? Play this.

291
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:17,800
A little card called Grave Robbers.

292
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,171
During all the commotion,

293
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:25,536
this little guy snuck into Merrick's
graveyard and stole a card for me.

294
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:26,680
That's right.

295
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:30,257
He grabbed the card that you used
against me a little while ago.

296
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:32,480
Does Spell of Pain ring a bell?

297
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,077
You'll pay for this.

298
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:37,480
This card lets me transfer
my damage to someone else.

299
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:40,357
So I thought I'd let you
take the fall, Merrick.

300
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,680
Awesome move, Joey!

301
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:46,237
It looks like you were one step ahead
of everyone else for a change, buddy!

302
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:49,360
Way to go, Joey! Keep it up! Thanks, guys.

303
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,340
That was an awesome move!

304
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:55,137
If Joey would have attacked Merrick's
Dark Geroid with his Axe Raider,

305
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:57,797
Merrick would have only
lost 500 life points.

306
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:02,477
So instead, Joey attacked Kaiba,
figuring that Kaiba had a hidden trap.

307
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,400
And when Kaiba struck back,

308
00:17:04,740 --> 00:17:09,460
Joey was able to redirect the damage at
Marek, causing Marek to lose everything.

309
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:12,600
Excellent strategy, Joey.

310
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:13,980
Thanks a lot, Yoke.

311
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:19,380
Looks like you're on the
express elevator to Loserville.

312
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:20,900
Buh-bye now.

313
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:23,120
I'll deal with you shortly.

314
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:29,498
Marek's out, and the next duelist
to lose faces him in the semifinals.

315
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,037
I just gotta make sure that's me.

316
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:32,620
Hold on, you guys.

317
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:35,137
Now Joey has no monsters
to protect himself.

318
00:17:35,220 --> 00:17:37,077
Plus, he has no face-down cards.

319
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:41,740
And it's my brother's turn, so I'd say
he's in big trouble now. We'll see.

320
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,050
All right.

321
00:17:43,133 --> 00:17:45,177
I think I've done enough for right now.

322
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:47,620
So I'm gonna go ahead and end my turn.

323
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:51,480
Let's see what you can do.

324
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:54,540
I can do quite a bit, so watch this.

325
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:57,257
You're done for. My move!

326
00:17:57,340 --> 00:18:01,220
You'll always be a second-rate
duelist in my book, Wheeler.

327
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:03,040
Blade Knight, go!

328
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:05,302
Attack his life points directly!

329
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:09,320
It's all over, Wheeler.

330
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:14,280
You did it.

331
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:17,300
Yeah, I'm facing Marek now.

332
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:20,180
That worked out for everyone.

333
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:25,307
Now Yugi's going up against Kaiba in the
next round, and I can take down Marek.

334
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:28,597
Nancy meeting you here.

335
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,800
Prepare to enter the shadows.

336
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:35,400
I've been waiting for this
a long time. Let's go.

337
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:36,800
This duel is over.

338
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:40,200
The semifinal bouts have
now been determined.

339
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:44,780
It looks like I'll be facing off
against Yugi in the next round.

340
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:46,400
Just as I planned.

341
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:52,420
The first semifinal duel will be
Merrick Ishtar against Joey Wheeler.

342
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,120
Followed by Mr.

343
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:57,180
Kaiba against Yugi Moto.

344
00:18:57,780 --> 00:19:02,020
One of us will get past the next
round, the other goes home a loser.

345
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:05,437
I have to defeat Kaiba and
make it to the final round!

346
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:08,461
The future of the entire
world could depend on it!

347
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:11,080
Open the tower gates now!

348
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:16,220
It's time to proceed to
the next dueling site!

349
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:22,300
I trust you're ready to join your
friend Mai in the Shadow Realm!

350
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,240
Guess again!

351
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:26,481
I'm gonna crush you and
get her out of that place!

352
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,170
Ha ha ha ha!

353
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:33,778
Launch the dueling platforms
to the top of the tower.

354
00:19:34,780 --> 00:19:37,440
And let the semifinals begin!
